OL,3,AWoman killed in Times Square stabbing,
OL,4,Asuspect shot dead by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old woman was killed and
OL,7,Fanother victim is in hospital following
OL,8,Fa stabbing in Times Square, New York
OL,9,FCity late on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,11,FThe suspect, a woman wielding two
OL,12,Fknifes, was shot by police. All three
OL,13,Fpeople were taken to hospital, where
OL,14,Fthe female victim and the suspect were
OL,15,Flater pronounced dead, New York City
OL,16,FMayor Zohran Mamdani told a news
OL,17,Fconference.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
