OL,3,AWoman killed in Times Square stabbing,
OL,4,Asuspect shot dead by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FMamdani said the second victim is in a
OL,7,F"stable condition". He also thanked
OL,8,FNYPD officers for preventing a
OL,9,F"horrific attack from becoming even
OL,10,Fworse".
OL,12,FNew York Police Department (NYPD)
OL,13,FCommissioner Jessica Tisch called the
OL,14,Fattack "an unprovoked double stabbing"
OL,15,Fthat took place within approximately 20
OL,16,Fseconds of each other.
